# SpecKit Implementation Plan: Shopping List Application

## 1. Project Setup & Architecture

### 1.1 Technology Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict mode)
- **Styling**: SCSS with CSS Modules
- **Hosting**: Vercel
- **State Management**: React Context + useReducer
- **Testing**: Jest + React Testing Library + Playwright
- **Package Manager**: npm

### 1.2 Project Structure
```
shopping/
├── app/                          # Next.js App Router
│   ├── globals.scss              # Global styles
│   ├── layout.tsx                # Root layout
│   ├── page.tsx                  # Home page
│   └── components/               # Page-specific components
├── components/                   # Shared components
│   ├── ui/                       # Base UI components
│   │   ├── Button/
│   │   │   ├── Button.tsx
│   │   │   ├── Button.module.scss
│   │   │   └── index.ts
│   │   ├── Input/
│   │   │   ├── Input.tsx
│   │   │   ├── Input.module.scss
│   │   │   └── index.ts
│   │   └── Modal/
│   ├── layout/                   # Layout components
│   │   ├── Header/
│   │   ├── Navigation/
│   │   └── Container/
│   ├── shopping/                 # Feature components
│   │   ├── ShoppingListSelector/
│   │   ├── AddItemForm/
│   │   ├── ItemsList/
│   │   ├── ItemRow/
│   │   ├── CategoryGroup/
│   │   └── BulkActions/
├── contexts/                     # React contexts
│   ├── ShoppingContext.tsx
│   └── UIContext.tsx
├── hooks/                        # Custom hooks
│   ├── useShoppingList.ts
│   ├── useLocalStorage.ts
│   └── useKeyboardShortcuts.ts
├── types/                        # TypeScript definitions
│   ├── shopping.ts
│   ├── ui.ts
│   └── index.ts
├── utils/                        # Utility functions
│   ├── storage.ts
│   ├── validation.ts
│   └── categories.ts
├── styles/                       # Global SCSS
│   ├── globals.scss
│   ├── variables.scss
│   ├── mixins.scss
│   └── breakpoints.scss
├── __tests__/                    # Test files
├── public/                       # Static assets
└── docs/                         # Documentation
```

### 1.3 Component Organization Pattern
Each component follows this structure:
```
ComponentName/
├── ComponentName.tsx             # Component logic
├── ComponentName.module.scss     # Component styles
├── ComponentName.test.tsx        # Component tests
├── ComponentName.stories.tsx     # Storybook stories (optional)
└── index.ts                      # Export barrel
```

## 2. Design System & Styling

### 2.1 Color Palette
```scss
// styles/variables.scss
:root {
  // Base Colors
  --color-background: #fafafa;        // Off-white background
  --color-surface: #ffffff;          // Card/surface white
  --color-text-primary: #1e3a8a;     // Darker blue text
  --color-text-secondary: #3b82f6;   // Medium blue
  --color-text-muted: #6b7280;       // Gray text
  
  // Action Colors
  --color-add: #22c55e;              // Green - Add actions
  --color-edit: #eab308;             // Yellow - Edit actions
  --color-delete: #ef4444;           // Red - Delete actions
  
  // State Colors
  --color-success: #10b981;
  --color-warning: #f59e0b;
  --color-error: #f87171;
  --color-info: #3b82f6;
  
  // Neutral Colors
  --color-border: #e5e7eb;
  --color-border-focus: #3b82f6;
  --color-disabled: #9ca3af;
  
  // Shadows
  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
}
```

### 2.2 Typography Scale
```scss
// styles/variables.scss
:root {
  // Font Family
  --font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  
  // Font Sizes (Mobile-first)
  --font-size-xs: 0.75rem;    // 12px
  --font-size-sm: 0.875rem;   // 14px
  --font-size-base: 1rem;     // 16px
  --font-size-lg: 1.125rem;   // 18px
  --font-size-xl: 1.25rem;    // 20px
  --font-size-2xl: 1.5rem;    // 24px
  --font-size-3xl: 1.875rem;  // 30px
  
  // Line Heights
  --line-height-tight: 1.25;
  --line-height-normal: 1.5;
  --line-height-relaxed: 1.625;
  
  // Font Weights
  --font-weight-normal: 400;
  --font-weight-medium: 500;
  --font-weight-semibold: 600;
  --font-weight-bold: 700;
}
```

### 2.3 Spacing & Layout
```scss
// styles/variables.scss
:root {
  // Spacing Scale
  --space-1: 0.25rem;   // 4px
  --space-2: 0.5rem;    // 8px
  --space-3: 0.75rem;   // 12px
  --space-4: 1rem;      // 16px
  --space-5: 1.25rem;   // 20px
  --space-6: 1.5rem;    // 24px
  --space-8: 2rem;      // 32px
  --space-10: 2.5rem;   // 40px
  --space-12: 3rem;     // 48px
  --space-16: 4rem;     // 64px
  
  // Container Sizes
  --container-sm: 640px;
  --container-md: 768px;
  --container-lg: 1024px;
  --container-xl: 1280px;
  
  // Border Radius
  --border-radius-sm: 0.25rem;
  --border-radius-md: 0.375rem;
  --border-radius-lg: 0.5rem;
  --border-radius-xl: 0.75rem;
}
```

### 2.4 Breakpoint System (Mobile-First)
```scss
// styles/breakpoints.scss
$breakpoints: (
  sm: 640px,   // Small tablets
  md: 768px,   // Tablets
  lg: 1024px,  // Small desktops
  xl: 1280px,  // Large desktops
);

@mixin respond-to($breakpoint) {
  @if map-has-key($breakpoints, $breakpoint) {
    @media (min-width: map-get($breakpoints, $breakpoint)) {
      @content;
    }
  }
}

// Usage:
// .component {
//   // Mobile styles (default)
//   padding: var(--space-4);
//   
//   @include respond-to(md) {
//     // Tablet styles
//     padding: var(--space-6);
//   }
//   
//   @include respond-to(lg) {
//     // Desktop styles
//     padding: var(--space-8);
//   }
// }
```

## 3. Component Implementation Plan

### 3.1 Base UI Components

#### 3.1.1 Button Component
```typescript
// components/ui/Button/Button.tsx
interface ButtonProps {
  variant: 'add' | 'edit' | 'delete' | 'primary' | 'secondary';
  size: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg';
  children: React.ReactNode;
  onClick?: () => void;
  disabled?: boolean;
  loading?: boolean;
  fullWidth?: boolean;
  type?: 'button' | 'submit' | 'reset';
}
```

```scss
// components/ui/Button/Button.module.scss
.button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
  font-family: var(--font-family);
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
  min-height: 44px; // Touch target size
  
  &:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  
  &:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-border-focus);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
}

.size-sm {
  padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
}

.size-md {
  padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
  font-size: var(--font-size-base);
}

.size-lg {
  padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
}

.variant-add {
  background-color: var(--color-add);
  color: white;
  
  &:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: #16a34a;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  
  &:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.variant-edit {
  background-color: var(--color-edit);
  color: white;
  
  &:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: #ca8a04;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
}

.variant-delete {
  background-color: var(--color-delete);
  color: white;
  
  &:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: #dc2626;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
}

.full-width {
  width: 100%;
}

.loading {
  position: relative;
  color: transparent;
  
  &::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border: 2px solid currentColor;
    border-top-color: transparent;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
  }
}

@keyframes spin {
  to {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(360deg);
  }
}
```

#### 3.1.2 Input Component
```typescript
