  - Build custom hooks

### 8.2 Phase 2: Core Features (Week 2)
- [ ] **Day 8-10**: Shopping list management
  - Implement list creation/deletion
  - Build list selector component
  - Add list switching functionality
  - Create responsive header layout
  
- [ ] **Day 11-14**: Item management
  - Build AddItemForm component
